% <char> #fill [#outline]. '.' is transparent. '@' and '%' are reserved. The outline column is the darker
% ramp step used by `outline`; without it the build darkens the neighbouring colour.
@palette
g #6b7d3a #2f3d22
l #a9b45a #2f3d22
y #f0d466 #8f6f45
T #e08a2c #5e2a1f
H #f0d466 #8f6f45
r #b5532f #5e2a1f
a #ff00ff
